# Patch series for raylib on Android
# Patches are applied in order listed here

# PLATFORM=AndroidHosted: raylib renders into a surface the application owns
# (the SurfaceView's ANativeWindow, handed through LiteCGSS' JNI bridge and
# host surface) instead of owning a NativeActivity. No
# android_main / native_app_glue, no asset-manager fopen() (LiteRGSS reads the
# file system), OpenGL ES 3. Host API: raylib_android_hosted.h (installed).
# Its new files (rcore_android_hosted.c, raylib_android_hosted.h) are not in
# the patch: raylib.cmake copies them from dependencies/files/raylib/.
android-hosted-platform.patch
